  "body": "Elevated from the road and framed by established trees, this property is a true DIY delight in need of repair and updating. Set on a generous 737sqm (more or less) site, it presents an incredible blank canvas to roll up your sleeves  or explore its options as a potential development site  (Zoned Residential - Mixed Housing Suburban) .   \r\n\r\nWhile the home and deck needs work to bring it back to its best, a head start has been made with a beautifully renovated family bathroom. The layout features four bedrooms, a gas hob, gas hot water system ,separate toilet and separate lounge from the dining / kitchen.   The dining space connects to a large, wrap-around outdoor deck area, offering a great footprint for future entertaining.   Thoughtfully designed to be wheelchair friendly, it features convenient undercover access from the carport directly into the home and ramped transitions along the outdoor decking.   Outside, the expansive grounds offer plenty of room for kids to play or for the gardening enthusiast to transform the landscape.\r\n\r\n\r\nA major drawcard for families is the exceptional local education options. In zone for the following highly regarded schools:\r\n* Pinehill School - Primary\r\n* Sherwood School - Primary\r\n* Northcross Intermediate\r\n* Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n* Rangitoto College\r\n* Long Bay College\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to secure a versatile property with significant land value and lifestyle appeal in a highly sought-after North Shore location.\r\n\r\nCall the agents for a viewing or more information.\r\n\r\n*Internal Photos are staged.",
